      390.99,
      287.4,
      501.67
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for the public purpose mentioned below: Description of the land to be acquired:",
