    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      503.12,
      286.45,
      570.56
    ],
    "text": "Following allotments of lands bearing Lot 01 (Extent : 2.3033 Hec.) depicted in the preliminary survey plan bearing No. MR/2698, situated in the Village of Naotunna, Grama Niladhari Division of Naotunna in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Devinuwara, Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
